<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2034611739"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1679761566"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="あぼーん"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Daoko"/><amll:meta key="album" value="あぼーん"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:35.600"><div begin="00:00.442" end="02:35.600"><p begin="00:00.442" end="00:01.477" itunes:key="L1">パラファンクション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身体机能紊乱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa ra fa n ku sho n</span></p><p begin="00:01.478" end="00:02.988" itunes:key="L2">沈み込んでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使浑噩沉沦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu mi ko n de mo</span></p><p begin="00:02.989" end="00:05.346" itunes:key="L3">浮きたくはない日です♪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不愿摆脱冗杂日常</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ki ta ku wa na i hi de su</span></p><p begin="00:05.347" end="00:06.173" itunes:key="L4">(Hit!death!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 孤独的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a ko do ku na bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="00:06.174" end="00:08.102" itunes:key="L5">ああ 孤独な凡人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 孤独的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a ko do ku na bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="00:08.103" end="00:09.637" itunes:key="L6">アウトオブ眼中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不能入我法眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a u to o bu ga n chu u</span></p><p begin="00:09.638" end="00:11.528" itunes:key="L7">泡立つきみの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在如同泡沫般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a wa da tsu ki mi no</span></p><p begin="00:12.030" end="00:13.586" itunes:key="L8">鳴ってるビートで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">震颤的节拍中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na 't te ru bi i to de</span></p><p begin="00:13.587" end="00:15.208" itunes:key="L9">感じるフィールを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">阵阵刺激来袭</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ji ru fi i ru wo</span></p><p begin="00:15.209" end="00:16.744" itunes:key="L10">早速聴いてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赶快听听这首歌曲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa 's so ku ki i te ru</span></p><p begin="00:16.745" end="00:18.242" itunes:key="L11">おにいさんおねえさん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哥哥和姐姐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ni i sa n o ne e sa n</span></p><p begin="00:18.243" end="00:19.887" itunes:key="L12">大人なんですか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是成年人吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to na na n de su ka ？</span></p><p begin="00:19.888" end="00:22.132" itunes:key="L13">子供なんですが どう？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是个小孩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do mo na n de su ga do u ？</span></p><p begin="00:22.133" end="00:24.664" itunes:key="L14">そちらの世界は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那边的世界感觉如何？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so chi ra no se ka i wa</span></p><p begin="00:24.665" end="00:26.039" itunes:key="L15">Wa wa what’s up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Wa wa what’s up!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ma 't ta ku ta no shi so u ni mi e na i</span></p><p begin="00:26.040" end="00:29.319" itunes:key="L16">ま、まったく 楽しそうに見えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看上去完全不像乐在其中啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ma 't ta ku ta no shi so u ni mi e na i</span></p><p begin="00:29.320" end="00:32.482" itunes:key="L17">不思議ないきものだ ワ wa<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是不可思议的生物啊 哇 wa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu shi gi na i ki mo no da wa wa</span></p><p begin="00:32.483" end="00:35.005" itunes:key="L18">我々霊長類<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们灵长类动物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa re wa re re i cho u ru i</span></p><p begin="00:35.006" end="00:37.377" itunes:key="L19">M(_ _"m)ペコリ 平常心保つ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点头哈腰 保持平常心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pe ko ri he i jo u shi n ta mo tsu</span></p><p begin="00:37.378" end="00:38.874" itunes:key="L20">あぼーん<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转瞬间消失不见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a bo o n</span></p><p begin="00:38.875" end="00:43.582" itunes:key="L21">しゃぼん玉のように儚く散れたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像肥皂泡一般脆弱飘散</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sha bo n da ma no yo u ni ha ka na ku chi re ta ra</span></p><p begin="00:43.583" end="00:45.067" itunes:key="L22">だが実際は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是实际上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ga ji 's sa i wa</span></p><p begin="00:45.068" end="00:48.173" itunes:key="L23">トマトを投げたようだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却像扔出西红柿一般沉重</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ma to wo na ge ta yo u da 't ta</span></p><p begin="00:50.513" end="00:51.648" itunes:key="L24">パラファンクション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身体机能紊乱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa ra fa n ku sho n</span></p><p begin="00:51.649" end="00:53.223" itunes:key="L25">沈み込んでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使浑噩沉沦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu mi ko n de mo</span></p><p begin="00:53.224" end="00:55.508" itunes:key="L26">浮きたくはない日です♪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不愿摆脱冗杂日常</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ki ta ku wa na i hi de su</span></p><p begin="00:55.509" end="00:56.368" itunes:key="L27">(Hit!death!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 孤独的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a ko do ku na bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="00:56.369" end="00:58.249" itunes:key="L28">ああ 孤独な凡人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 孤独的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a ko do ku na bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="00:58.250" end="00:59.818" itunes:key="L29">アウトオブ眼中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不能入我法眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a u to o bu ga n chu u</span></p><p begin="00:59.819" end="01:02.831" itunes:key="L30">泡立つきみのことばになんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同泡沫一般的空话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a wa da tsu ki mi no ko to ba ni na n te</span></p><p begin="01:03.089" end="01:04.198" itunes:key="L31">パラファンクション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身体机能紊乱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa ra fa n ku sho n</span></p><p begin="01:04.199" end="01:05.773" itunes:key="L32">誰の本気も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何人的真心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re no ho n ki mo</span></p><p begin="01:05.774" end="01:08.085" itunes:key="L33">目にしたくない日です♪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都不愿认真面对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ni shi ta ku na i hi de su</span></p><p begin="01:08.086" end="01:08.965" itunes:key="L34">(Hit!death!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 追梦的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a mo to me ru bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="01:08.966" end="01:10.797" itunes:key="L35">ああ 求める凡人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 寻求普通的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a mo to me ru bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="01:10.798" end="01:12.233" itunes:key="L36">ひたすらウォンチュー♡<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一心一意追寻着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ta su ra u o n chu u</span></p><p begin="01:12.234" end="01:14.706" itunes:key="L37">こんな人生は厭厭！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早已彻底厌倦这样的人生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ji n se i wa i ya i ya</span></p><p begin="01:14.974" end="01:16.357" itunes:key="L38">子供なんですが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是个小孩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko do mo na n de su ga</span></p><p begin="01:16.358" end="01:18.107" itunes:key="L39">大人なんてバカ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大人们全都是笨蛋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o to na na n te ba ka</span></p><p begin="01:18.108" end="01:20.948" itunes:key="L40">あっ、ぶたないでっ 破かないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 不要捶打 不要撕破</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ' bu ta na i de ' ya bu ka na i de</span></p><p begin="01:20.949" end="01:22.611" itunes:key="L41">わたしの世界を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要毁坏我的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no se ka i wo</span></p><p begin="01:22.612" end="01:25.422" itunes:key="L42">あなたも見ていたはずなのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明你也看到了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta mo mi te i ta ha zu na no ni</span></p><p begin="01:25.423" end="01:27.392" itunes:key="L43">幕が下り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">落下帷幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ku ga o ri</span></p><p begin="01:27.393" end="01:30.436" itunes:key="L44">Good 朝モーニング 風化はとうに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早上好 风化作用</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Good a sa mo o ni n gu fu u ka wa to u ni</span></p><p begin="01:30.437" end="01:32.054" itunes:key="L45">起こってるんだから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早都发生 所以我就</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ko 't te ru n da ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:32.055" end="01:33.614" itunes:key="L46">食う haha ソーリー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直接开吃了 抱歉啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku u haha so o ri i</span></p><p begin="01:33.615" end="01:35.237" itunes:key="L47">無駄はポイしてよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没用的东西就随手扔掉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu da wa po i shi te yo</span></p><p begin="01:35.238" end="01:36.887" itunes:key="L48">恋したいの放棄しないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过渴望爱恋的心可不会放弃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko i shi ta i no ho u ki shi na i yo</span></p><p begin="01:36.888" end="01:39.898" itunes:key="L49">って あーやだ！ややこいのなんの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊—好烦躁 复杂的事我一概不知</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">'t te a a ya da ya ya ko i no na n no</span></p><p begin="01:39.899" end="01:43.013" itunes:key="L50">ただ恋をしようよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只管尽情沉醉于爱恋吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da ko i wo shi yo u yo</span></p><p begin="01:43.014" end="01:47.001" itunes:key="L51">争いも全部 あざといの系譜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所谓的纷争全是狡猾之举</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra so i mo ze n bu a za to i no ke i fu</span></p><p begin="01:47.002" end="01:52.530" itunes:key="L52">まだいいのに まだいいのに…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明如此就好 明明还能继续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da i i no ni ma da i i no ni</span></p><p begin="01:56.399" end="01:57.499" itunes:key="L53">パラファンクション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身体机能紊乱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa ra fa n ku sho n</span></p><p begin="01:57.500" end="01:59.103" itunes:key="L54">沈み込んでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使浑噩沉沦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu mi ko n de mo</span></p><p begin="01:59.104" end="02:01.415" itunes:key="L55">浮きたくはない日です♪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不愿摆脱冗杂日常</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ki ta ku wa na i hi de su</span></p><p begin="02:01.416" end="02:02.221" itunes:key="L56">(Hit!death!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 孤独的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a ko do ku na bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="02:02.222" end="02:04.214" itunes:key="L57">ああ 孤独な凡人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 孤独的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a ko do ku na bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="02:04.215" end="02:05.678" itunes:key="L58">アウトオブ眼中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不能入我法眼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a u to o bu ga n chu u</span></p><p begin="02:05.679" end="02:08.723" itunes:key="L59">泡立つきみのことばになんて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同泡沫一般的空话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a wa da tsu ki mi no ko to ba ni na n te</span></p><p begin="02:08.978" end="02:10.070" itunes:key="L60">パラファンクション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身体机能紊乱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pa ra fa n ku sho n</span></p><p begin="02:10.071" end="02:11.616" itunes:key="L61">誰の本気も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何人的真心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re no ho n ki mo</span></p><p begin="02:11.617" end="02:13.943" itunes:key="L62">目にしたくない日です♪<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都不愿认真面对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ni shi ta ku na i hi de su</span></p><p begin="02:13.944" end="02:14.884" itunes:key="L63">(Hit!death!)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 追梦的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a mo to me ru bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="02:14.885" end="02:16.696" itunes:key="L64">ああ 求める凡人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 寻求普通的凡人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a mo to me ru bo n ji n</span></p><p begin="02:16.697" end="02:18.185" itunes:key="L65">ひたすらウォンチュー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一心一意追寻着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ta su ra u o n chu u</span></p><p begin="02:18.186" end="02:35.600" itunes:key="L66">こんな人生は厭厭厭厭！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的人生早已彻底厌倦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na ji n se i wa i ya i ya i ya i ya</span></p></div></body></tt>